        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI aboola mbu Khunyanga eyo omuruchi alifwa omwoyo, nende abakhulundu bario; abakuhani nabo balachenya, abanabii nibahuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nisunga mbu E Omwami NYASAYE! Toto mwene, obakaatiye abandu bano nende abeYerusalemu muno, noboola mbu Mulabeetsanga nomulembe; nebutswa olukanga luulile khubulamu bwabwe bwene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
